      <Desc>THE ORGANIZATION ENGAGES IN STUDY AND RESEARCH TO DEVELOP DATA AND NEW INSIGHTS TO ASSIST PHILANTHROPIC ORGANIZATIONS AND THE GENERAL PUBLIC IMPROVE THE EFFECTIVENESS AND IMPACT OF THEIR OWN GIVING. THROUGH STUDY AND RESEARCH, THE ORGANIZATION IS GAINING LEARNING AND EXPERIENCE ABOUT THE CAUSES ACROSS PHILANTHROPIC CATEGORIES, INCLUDING DIRECT AID, RESEARCH AND DEVELOPMENT, AND POLICY ADVOCACY, SO THAT FUTURE GIVING WILL HAVE THE BROADEST AND MOST MEANINGFUL LONG-TERM IMPACT ON THE LIVES OF AS MANY PEOPLE AS POSSIBLE.</Desc>
